HANDOFF:
  next_bar: 35 [D]   key: C minor (after deceptive V7-vi, b33-34)
  meter 2/4   T=q66   dynamics: p/pp, everything stopped by b34 beat 2.
  At the seam: vc/cb pizz end c3/c2-g-c (b34 1st beat), vn1 & fl1 end
  on eb (eb5/eb6) quarter, cl1 g4, fg c3, vn2/va after-beat Cm chord on
  the 2nd 8th, hn12 (eb3 g3) quarter. Nothing sustains into b35.
  NEXT: b35 [D] the B section, C minor "storm": vc/cb ARCO play the
  Mvt-I CELL in 16ths (= the old ostinato at nearly its old speed),
  p, "come un ricordo"; ob1 laments with the T1 head in C minor; vn2/va
  tremolo; crescendo to ff climax b49-52 (Ab - N6 - Ger6 - V), then
  dying to the Bb7 dominant b56-60 for A' at b61.
